{
  "$comment": "The index of parity/source-inventory/, and the reconciliation between the node ids it holds and interlock's suite baseline. The inventory files themselves carry node ids and nothing else -- no comments, no notes -- because scripts/parity-check.mjs reads every non-empty line as a node id. Everything that is ABOUT the inventory lives here instead. Porting intent is deliberately not here either: see the belts document below.",
  "source": {
    "repository": "suisya-systems/interlock",
