    "collection_time_skipped_modules": 5,
    "reconciliation": "2,194 node ids + 5 modules skipped at collection time = 2,199. pytest reports a module-level skip separately from the collected count, so the two numbers are not in disagreement -- they count different things. Five of the eight skips are those collection-time ones; the other three are ordinary skipped cases and DO have node ids, so they are in the inventory. 2,190 is the passed count, an outcome breakdown, and is not the denominator.",
